  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "在理发店里洗头\n\n店员：您好，我是5号，今天由我帮您洗头。\n保罗：好的。\n店员：请您往上面坐一点。\n保罗：好的。\n店员：我先帮您按摩一下头部，放松一下。\n保罗：好的。\n店员：请问力度合适吗？\n保罗：合适。\n店员：现在开始给您洗头。请问水温合适吗？\n保罗：太热了。\n店员：不好意思。那我把温度调低一点。现在呢？\n保罗：合适了。\n店员：请问力度合适吗？\n保罗：太重了，轻一点。\n店员：好的。现在呢？\n保罗：合适了。\n店员：请问头还有哪个地方痒吗？\n保罗：没有了。\n店员：那现在我给您冲水，上护发素。\n保罗：好的。\n店员：洗好了。我扶您坐起来。\n保罗：谢谢！\n店员：不客气。",
    "traditional": "在理髮店裡洗頭\n\n店員：您好，我是5號，今天由我幫您洗頭。\n保羅：好的。\n店員：請您往上面坐一點。\n保羅：好的。\n店員：我先幫您按摩一下頭部，放鬆一下。\n保羅：好的。\n店員：請問力度合適嗎？\n保羅：合適。\n店員：現在開始給您洗頭。請問水溫合適嗎？\n保羅：太熱了。\n店員：不好意思。那我把溫度調低一點。現在呢？\n保羅：合適了。\n店員：請問力度合適嗎？\n保羅：太重了，輕一點。\n店員：好的。現在呢？\n保羅：合適了。\n店員：請問頭還有哪個地方癢嗎？\n保羅：沒有了。\n店員：那現在我給您沖水，上護髮素。\n保羅：好的。\n店員：洗好了。我扶您坐起來。\n保羅：謝謝！\n店員：不客氣。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Washing Your Hair at the Hairdresser’s"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "店员：您好，我是5号，今天由我帮您洗头。",
      "traditional": "店員：您好，我是5號，今天由我幫您洗頭。",
      "pinyin": "diàn yuán nín hǎo wǒ shì 1 hào jīn tiān yóu wǒ bāng nín xǐ tóu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Staff: Hello, I’m number 5. Today, I will help you wash your hair."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "保罗：好的。",
      "traditional": "保羅：好的。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó hǎo de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Ok."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "店员：请您往上面坐一点。",
      "traditional": "店員：請您往上面坐一點。",
      "pinyin": "diàn yuán qǐng nín wǎng shàng miàn zuò yì diǎn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Staff: Please sit a bit higher up."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "保罗：好的。",
      "traditional": "保羅：好的。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó hǎo de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Ok."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "店员：我先帮您按摩一下头部，放松一下。",
      "traditional": "店員：我先幫您按摩一下頭部，放鬆一下。",
      "pinyin": "diàn yuán wǒ xiān bāng nín àn mó yí xià tóu bù fàng sōng yí xià",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Staff: First, I will massage your head a bit. Please relax."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "保罗：好的。",
      "traditional": "保羅：好的。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó hǎo de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Ok."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "店员：请问力度合适吗？",
      "traditional": "店員：請問力度合適嗎？",
      "pinyin": "diàn yuán qǐng wèn lì dù hé shì ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Staff: May I ask if the amount of pressure is suitable?"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "保罗：合适。",
      "traditional": "保羅：合適。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó hé shì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: It’s suitable."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "店员：现在开始给您洗头。请问水温合适吗？",
      "traditional": "店員：現在開始給您洗頭。請問水溫合適嗎？",
      "pinyin": "diàn yuán xiàn zài kāi shǐ gěi nín xǐ tóu qǐng wèn shuǐ wēn hé shì ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Staff: Now, I will begin to wash your hair. May I ask if the water temperature is suitable?"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "保罗：太热了。",
      "traditional": "保羅：太熱了。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó tài rè le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: It’s too hot."
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "simplified": "店员：不好意思。那我把温度调低一点。现在呢？",
      "traditional": "店員：不好意思。那我把溫度調低一點。現在呢？",
      "pinyin": "diàn yuán bù hǎo yì si nà wǒ bǎ wēn dù tiáo dī yì diǎn xiàn zài ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Staff: I apologize. Then I will turn the water temperature down a bit. How about now?"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "simplified": "保罗：合适了。",
      "traditional": "保羅：合適了。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó hé shì le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: It’s good."
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "simplified": "店员：请问力度合适吗？",
      "traditional": "店員：請問力度合適嗎？",
      "pinyin": "diàn yuán qǐng wèn lì dù hé shì ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Staff: Is the pressure suitable?"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "simplified": "保罗：太重了，轻一点。",
      "traditional": "保羅：太重了，輕一點。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó tài zhòng le qīng yì diǎn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: It’s too hard. A bit softer, please."
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "simplified": "店员：好的。现在呢？",
      "traditional": "店員：好的。現在呢？",
      "pinyin": "diàn yuán hǎo de xiàn zài ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Staff: Ok. How about now?"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "simplified": "保罗：合适了。",
      "traditional": "保羅：合適了。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó hé shì le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: It’s good."
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "simplified": "店员：请问头还有哪个地方痒吗？",
      "traditional": "店員：請問頭還有哪個地方癢嗎？",
      "pinyin": "diàn yuán qǐng wèn tóu hái yǒu nǎ ge dì fang yǎng ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Staff: May I ask if any spot on your scalp is still itchy?"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "simplified": "保罗：没有了。",
      "traditional": "保羅：沒有了。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó méi yǒu le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: No."
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "simplified": "店员：那现在我给您冲水，上护发素。",
      "traditional": "店員：那現在我給您沖水，上護髮素。",
      "pinyin": "diàn yuán nà xiàn zài wǒ gěi nín chōng shuǐ shàng hù fà sù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Staff: Then I will rinse and apply conditioner now."
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "simplified": "保罗：好的。",
      "traditional": "保羅：好的。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó hǎo de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Ok."
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "simplified": "店员：洗好了。我扶您坐起来。",
      "traditional": "店員：洗好了。我扶您坐起來。",
      "pinyin": "diàn yuán xǐ hǎo le wǒ fú nín zuò qǐ lai",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Staff: I finished washing. I will help you sit up."
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "simplified": "保罗：谢谢！",
      "traditional": "保羅：謝謝！",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó xiè xie",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Thank you!"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "simplified": "店员：不客气。",
      "traditional": "店員：不客氣。",
      "pinyin": "diàn yuán bú kè qi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Staff: You’re welcome."
    }
  ],
